# Repo paths the guidance files name on purpose although they do not exist, one per line.
# `path: <value>` — spelled exactly as the backticked token is spelled.
# `link: <target>` — a relative link in the README or docs/ that is dead on purpose, spelled
# exactly as the link's target is spelled, anchor included.

# docs/agents/triage-labels.md names this to say there is no such folder here — the mattpocock
# skills' `wontfix` role maps onto Linear's Canceled state instead.
path: .out-of-scope/

# .claude/rules/brain.md points at the ConnerTechnology/AI repo's own docs/vision.md, not ours.
path: docs/vision.md
